1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,600
“Put your salary on the table!”

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,900
That's not what my father meant.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,200
“We fed you for twenty years!”

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,900
What he meant: I'm afraid you won't need me anymore.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,900
“I never asked to be born!”

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:21,000
What he meant: Dad, just once, tell me you're proud of me.

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,200
He bought his father a gift with his first salary.

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,500
He never got to give it.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,300
And his father had saved for twenty years to buy him a home.

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,100
They loved each other.

11
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,300
They just didn't know how to say it.

12
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,800
“I love you, Dad.”

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,900
“I love you too, son.”

14
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,600
Sometimes people say one thing,

15
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,900
but feel another in their heart.

16
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,800
Tell someone close “I love you” today.

17
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,000
If you can't, send them this video.

